  "summary": "Claude Code Viewer is a self-hosted web client that reads Claude Code JSONL session logs from ~/.claude/projects, offers real-time viewing, Git operations, an integrated terminal, and Agent-SDK chat features gated by authentication mode. Contributor rules in AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md are development practice, not product behavior. Evidence coverage: 157 of 162 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
